// Act 2 - Bio-Containment & Comms Array
// ======================================

title: BioContainment_Arrival
tags: act2, biocontainment, arrival
---
<<SetZone "BioContainment">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 6>>
    [Projection flickers near cryo-pods]
    "Bio-Containment. Specimens... preserved. Some... still alive."
    "Neural Loom... here. Memory... integration organ."
<<else>>
    "Bio-Containment. Two Vista Nodes. Observation Deck... Calibration Lab."
    "Neural Calibration... and Purge Protocol. Puzzles... linked."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "BioContainment_Observation">>
    Astra: "Observation Deck. First node. Neural Calibration puzzle."
    "Cryo-pods... three viable subjects. Must... identify."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Observation... complete. Calibration Lab... awaits."
<</if>>

-> Choice_BioContainment
===

title: Choice_BioContainment
---
+ [Approach Observation Deck] -> Node_BioContainment_Observation_Approach
+ [Approach Calibration Lab] -> Node_BioContainment_Calibration_Approach
+ "What happened to the specimens?" -> Dialogue_BioSpecimens
+ "Tell me about the Neural Loom." -> Dialogue_NeuralLoom
+ "Astra... you seem different." -> Dialogue_AstraChanging
+ [Fast Travel] -> Command_ShowJournal_Map
===

title: Dialogue_BioSpecimens
---
Astra: "1950s. Military... recovered alien biology. From crash site."
"Cryo-pods... test subjects. Human... and *other*."
"Dr. Thorne... experimented. Neural mapping. Consciousness transfer."
"Most... died. Three... survived. Phased... like the staff."
"Their minds... scattered. Neural Loom... can reassemble."

-> Choice_BioContainment
===

title: Dialogue_NeuralLoom
---
Astra: "Neural Loom... second organ. Memory. Integration. Identity."
"Without... I am fragments. Disconnected. Fading."
"With... I remember. *Who* I am. *What* we were."
"Chronos Core... gives time. Neural Loom... gives *meaning*."
"Restore it. Please."

-> Choice_BioContainment
===

title: Dialogue_AstraChanging
---
Astra: <<if $trust >= 6>>
    "You notice. Good."
    "Trust... builds coherence. Fragments... align."
    "I remember... the *Chronos*'s launch. The crew. The mission."
    "We were... explorers. Scientists. Not weapons."
    "The fracture... stole that. You... are giving it back."
<<else>>
    "I... function. Fragments return. Clarity... improves."
    "But the fracture... pulls. Constant."
    "Your progress... anchors me."
<</if>>

-> Choice_BioContainment
===

title: Node_BioContainment_Observation_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "BioContainment_Observation">>
Astra: "Observation Deck. Neural Calibration. Three subjects... viable."
"Subject 3. Subject 7. Subject 12. Neural activity... high."

-> Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Observation
===

title: Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Observation
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "BioContainment_Observation">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_BioContainment_Observation">>

Astra: "1957. Post-meltdown. Neural mapping... in progress."
"Puzzle: **Neural Calibration**. Identify viable subjects."
"[Scan] cryo-pods. Vitals... reveal... neural coherence."

<<SetActivePuzzle "BioContainment_NeuralCalibration">>

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Start
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] each pod. Subject 3... Alpha waves stable."
"Subject 7... Beta synchronized. Subject 12... Gamma resonant."
"Others... flatline. Or... noise."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_CRYO_VITALS">>

Astra: "Command me: [Hold] at viable pods. Sequence... matters."
"Pathway... Alpha to Beta to Gamma to Delta. Bidirectional."

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step1
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step1
---
Astra: "Subject 3... engaged. Neural pathway... opening. Subject 7... next."
"[Hold] at Pod 7. Timing... 1.0 second window."

// Player executes Hold at Pod 7
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_NEURAL_PATHWAYS">>

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step2
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step2
---
Astra: "Subject 7... synchronized. Subject 12... final. Gamma... resonant."
"[Hold] at Pod 12. Bidirectional... flow. Both directions."

// Player executes Hold at Pod 12
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_CALIBRATION_TIMING">>

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step3
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Step3
---
Astra: "Calibration... synchronized at Observation. But... Calibration Lab... required."
"Second node. Simultaneous sync. Astra... at Lab. You... at Observation."
"0.5 second window. Together."

Corwin: [Voice over comms, 1957]
"Thorne's neural mapping... ambitious. Dangerous."
"Subjects... conscious. They *feel* the fracture."
"Proceed... carefully. Or don't. Data... either way."

-> Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Calibration
===

title: Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Calibration
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "BioContainment_Calibration">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_BioContainment_Calibration">>

Astra: "Calibration Lab. 1957. Simultaneous synchronization."
"Command me: [Hold] at Lab console. You... [Hold] at Observation."
"Window... 1.0 second. Trust... timing."

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Sync
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Sync
---
Astra: "Ready... Navigator. On my mark."
"Three... two... one... *mark*."

// Simultaneous Hold - success check in C++

-> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Result
===

title: Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Result
---
<<if $active_puzzle_success>>
    Astra: "Synchronized. Neural Loom... calibrated. Pathways... integrated."
    "Memory... flooding. Fragments... aligning."
    
    <<MarkPuzzleSolved "BioContainment_NeuralCalibration">>
    <<AddResonance 200>>
    <<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_4">>
    <<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_5">>
    <<AddTrust 2>>
    <<GrantOrgan "NeuralLoom">>
    <<SetAstraVisualState "memory">>
    
    Astra: "NEURAL LOOM RESTORED."
    "Past Vision... unlocked. Resonance cost: 10/sec."
    "Memory fragments... accessible. Clarity... rising."
    
    <<SetEndingFlag "neural_loom_restored" true>>
    <<UnlockFastTravel "CommsArray">>
    
    -> Phase_Shift_Return_BioContainment_Observation
<<else>>
    Astra: "Failed. Synchronization... lost. Pathways... destabilizing."
    "Try again. Trust... the rhythm."
    
    -> Puzzle_NeuralCalibration_Sync
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_BioContainment_Observation
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "BioContainment_Observation">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_BioContainment_Observation_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Containment cleared. Specimen access... open."
"Purge Protocol... next. Calibration Lab node."
"Comms Array... accessible. Void Sail... awaits."
"Navigator... proceed."

-> Choice_BioContainment
===

title: Node_BioContainment_Calibration_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "BioContainment_Calibration">>
<<if not HasSolvedPuzzle "BioContainment_NeuralCalibration">>
    Astra: "Calibration Lab. Purge Protocol. But... Neural Calibration... incomplete."
    "Complete... Observation first. Pathways... before purge."
    -> Choice_BioContainment
<<else>>
    Astra: "Calibration Lab. Purge Protocol. Vent → Sterilize → Seal → Verify."
    "Astra commands... sequence. Scan, Wait, Hold, Recall."
    -> Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Purge
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_BioContainment_Purge
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "BioContainment_Calibration">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_BioContainment_Calibration">>

Astra: "1957. Containment breach. Purge... protocol active."
"Puzzle: **Containment Purge Protocol**. Environmental sequence."
"Four stages. Astra commands... each stage."

<<SetActivePuzzle "BioContainment_PurgeProtocol">>

-> Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Start
===

title: Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Start
---
Astra: "Stage 1: VENT. [Scan] pressure valves. Identify... sequence."
"Stage 2: STERILIZE. [Wait] for UV cycle. Timing... critical."
"Stage 3: SEAL. [Hold] blast doors. Simultaneous... both sides."
"Stage 4: VERIFY. [Recall] me to sensor array. Confirm... clear."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_PURGE_PROTOCOL">>

-> Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Execute
---
Astra: "Executing... VENT."
"[Scan] valves. Sequence: Alpha, Gamma, Beta, Delta."
// Player executes Scan at each valve

Astra: "VENT complete. STERILIZE... initiating."
"[Wait] at UV console. 30 second cycle. Do not... interrupt."
// Player executes Wait

Astra: "STERILIZE complete. SEAL... ready."
"[Hold] at inner door. Astra... [Hold] at outer door. Simultaneous."
// Player and Astra Hold simultaneously

Astra: "SEAL complete. VERIFY... final."
"[Recall] me to sensor array. Confirm... contamination zero."
// Player executes Recall

-> Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_PurgeProtocol_Complete
---
Astra: "Purge... complete. Containment... sterile. Path... clear."
"Present... changed. Platform extended. Samples... accessible."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "BioContainment_PurgeProtocol">>
<<AddResonance 150>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_6">>
<<AddTrust 1>>
<<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>

Astra: "Bio-Containment... secured. Comms Array... next zone."
"Void Sail... awaits. Signal Triangulation... puzzle."
"Return... present."

<<UnlockFastTravel "CommsArray">>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_BioContainment_Calibration
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_BioContainment_Calibration
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "BioContainment_Calibration">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_BioContainment_Calibration_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Bio-Containment clear. Platform... to Comms Array... extended."
"Two organs restored. Two... remain."
"Void Sail... in Comms Array. Gravity Anchor... in Hangar 18."
"Navigator... the signal... calls."

-> Choice_BioContainment
===